<title>BELGIUM: Luxembourg May OLUX auction yield 5.694 pct.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg May OLUX auction yield 5.694 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Luxembourg bond auction held May 21:</p>
<p>5.50 pct, 23/05/2007 bond (new line)</p>
<p>Avg weighted price/yield  98.554/5.694 pct</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted price     97</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	 97 to 98.8</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		730 million Luxembourg francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	5.02 billion francs</p>
<p>NOTE - The Treasury said it would hold its next auction on June 18</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
